      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As you mentioned personally for me it's not the worst thing in the world the way it works now but damn could it be smoothed out a little. The network hit is not a problem for me but the performance hit of waiting for everything to load is horrendous.\nI would personally choose a loading setup of friends first to load all at once, then do one by one for anyone else in the world after all current friends have loaded at time of entrance. This way I get minimal wait time at spawn and can immediately go meet friends while the one by one loading should be just as fast with my internet anyway and should avoid the mass lag spike of multiple avatars trying to load at once.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
